Package: OntoAnno
Title: Cell Type Annotation for Single-Cell Analysis
Version: 2.0.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Yiran", "Song", , "yrsong001@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Ontology-grounded cell type annotation for parent clusters and
    subclusters, with repeated large language model inference and automatic
    selection of biologically coherent clustering resolutions.
